            "review_title": "Review at Quán Nhỏ Nha Trang",
            "review_text": "Clarissa G\n2 contributions\n0\nSuper\nNov 2024 • Solo\nI got there in the early afternoon, even if they were still setting up the outdoor tables, were super fast to accommodate me and explain me different dishes.\nI took a Crab Soup that was actually delicious. \nVery friendly and nice service. \nJust some street away from the chaos of the city centre, you can enjoy a peaceful meal 😊 raccomended!\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nAtmosphere\nWritten November 27, 2024",
            "rating": 5.0,
