            "review_title": "Review at Quán Nhỏ Nha Trang",
            "review_text": "Hà Thuỳ Ngân\n11 contributions\n0\nDelicious flavors from the sea combined with the culture of 3 regions\nFeb 2024 • Family\nI went to eat lobster noodle soup 🦞, the first feeling when eating shrimp was the sweet taste and crispy fresh shrimp meat, the tapioca noodle soup stem was the first time I ate a powder that is as transparent as crystal but absorbs the flavor. The sweetness of the soup cake water is left as is. In addition, Quan Nho features Vietnam's first shrimp paste seafood vermicelli with crab rolls, ground shrimp spring rolls, crispy fried baby intestines, snail rolls wrapped in betel leaves, mushroom spring rolls with ground meat and super delicious shrimp paste.\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nAtmosphere\nShow original\nWritten February 29, 2024",
            "rating": 5.0,
            "review_date": "2026-10-11",
            "travel_date": "Recent",
            "feature_depth_status": "Schema-Full-Features-Validated"
        },
