            "review_text": "Wanderer54256469794\nHanoi, Vietnam3 contributions\n0\nVisit Nha Trang Small Restaurant to enjoy traditional Vietnamese dishes\nNov 2023 • Family\nThe restaurant has a very special lobster soup dish. The shrimp paste of the vermicelli dish is especially delicious. Vietnamese cuisine is very good. Good price. Will stop by the restaurant again when I come to Nha Trang.\nValue\nService\nFood\nAtmosphere\nShow original\nWritten November 11, 2023",
